          %h4#in_explicit_parametricity In explicit parametricity
          %p
            Suppose that the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dependent+type+theory"} dependent type theory
            has
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/explicit+parametricity"} explicit parametricity
            with
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/unary+bridge+types"} unary bridge types
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %msub
                      %mi{:mathvariant => "normal"} Br
                      %mi A
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi x
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %msub
