                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                      %mi X
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S^+:\prod_{X:U^{\Delta_{+}^\op}} T(Z^+(X)) \to \mathrm{Br}_{U^{\Delta_{+}^\op}}(X)
          %p
            An indexed semi-simplicial type is simply an element of
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
